    "detect": ["%PROGRAMDATA%\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Support"],
    "category": "app_logs",
    "name": "Defender 支持日志",
    "description": "Windows Defender 支持诊断日志",
    "targets": [{"base": "%PROGRAMDATA%\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\Support", "patterns": ["*.log", "*.old"]}],
    "risk": "caution",
    "requires_admin": true,
    "default_selected": false,
    "clean_subdirs_only": false,
    "why_safe": "Windows Defender 自身的诊断日志，不是病毒库也不是隔离区。删了不影响实时防护和扫描能力,但当 Defender 自己出问题(比如扫描卡住、定义更新失败)你拿不到给微软支持的排错记录。日常没毛病时可以勾,正在排查 Defender 问题就别动。"
  },
  {
